4. CREATE FOOTER COMPONENT
================================================================================

File:

src/components/Footer.jsx


Code:

function Footer() {

  return (
    <div>
      Footer
    </div>
  );

}

export default Footer;


Explanation:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

function Footer()
-> Creates the Footer functional component

return (...)
-> Returns JSX

<div>Footer</div>
-> Displays Footer content

export default Footer
-> Makes Footer available to other components


